<div class="quarto-title">
<h1 class="title">Bayesian computations for Value of Information measures using Gaussian processes, INLA and Moment Matching</h1>
<p class="subtitle lead"><a href="https://github.com/giabaio/EVSI"><i class="fa-brands fa-github" title="GitHub code" aria-label="github"></i></a> &nbsp; <a href="http://www.convoi-group.org/"><i class="fa-brands fa-firefox" title="ConVOI website" aria-label="firefox"></i></a> &nbsp; <a href="https://twitter.com/ConVOIgroup"><i class="fa-brands fa-twitter" title="Follow ConVOI on Twitter" aria-label="twitter"></i></a></p>
  <div class="quarto-categories">
    <div class="quarto-category">Health Economics</div>
    <div class="quarto-category">Hierarchical models</div>
    <div class="quarto-category">PhD project</div>
  </div>
  </div>


